    <h2>Double Cheeseburger — The Right Step Up</h2>
  <p>The Double Cheeseburger is for guests who want more beef than the <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> delivers but do not need the premium toppings of a Stackburger. Two patties, two slices of American cheese, and the same classic toppings as the Original — but double the protein and staying power. Find all burger options on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>Original vs. Double vs. Stackburger — The Complete Burger Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Burger</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Best For</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Original Cheeseburger</td><td class="price-cell">$6.39</td><td>400 cal</td><td>Best value — $7 Meal Deal eligible</td></tr><tr><td>Double Cheeseburger</td><td class="price-cell">$7.99</td><td>560 cal</td><td>More beef, same toppings — for hungry guests</td></tr><tr><td>Two Cheese Deluxe Stackburger</td><td class="price-cell">$8.29</td><td>630 cal</td><td>Premium cheese, more toppings</td></tr><tr><td>Backyard Bacon Ranch Stackburger</td><td class="price-cell">$9.99</td><td>730 cal</td><td>Bacon + ranch — Stackburger tier</td></tr><tr><td>FlameThrower® Stackburger</td><td class="price-cell">$10.87</td><td>780 cal</td><td>Most premium, spicy</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Who Should Order the Double Cheeseburger</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Guests who found the Original Cheeseburger too small but do not want to pay Stackburger prices</li>
    <li>Guests who want more protein without adding complex toppings</li>
    <li>Guests ordering for children or sharing between two people who each want a smaller portion</li>
    <li>Anyone who genuinely loves the classic cheeseburger format and just wants more of it</li>
  </ul>

