<h2>Best Value Pairing for the Double Cheeseburger</h2>
<p>The Double Cheeseburger is not eligible for the <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a> (which uses the Original Cheeseburger). However, it qualifies for the <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a> at participating locations. Pairing it with Regular Fries in the 2-for-$5 gives you a Double + Fries for $5.00 — a strong value for a larger burger meal. Confirm eligibility at your local <a href="/locations">DQ location</a>.</p>
